# Installed addon trees if ever nested under the repo
**/addons/GW2-InGame-Helper/**
**/addons/GW2-InGame-Helper-Beta/**

# Android companion (local-only; not published with the Nexus addon)
Companion-App/

# Android / Java signing material (never commit private keys)
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# Local listing / announcement drafts (keep on disk; do not publish in git)
# Discord paste drafts, Raidcore listing notes, audits, partner briefs, Beta notes.
# Most of docs/ is local-only — only these are published in the repo:
#   RELEASE_NOTES.md · DPS_LOGS.md · WHITEPAPER.md · API_KEY.md · COMPLIANCE.md
docs/**
!docs/RELEASE_NOTES.md
!docs/DPS_LOGS.md
!docs/WHITEPAPER.md
!docs/API_KEY.md
!docs/COMPLIANCE.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
